{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Den-Den: Tokyo Horror is an open world, survival horror experience where you play as a caregiver for the elderly. Each night for one week, you must navigate the dark streets of Tokyo, choosing where to go and whom to care for. Not everyone can be saved. <br><br>Manage your limited resources, which are needed not only for the sake of those dependent upon you, but also for your own survival. Time is not on your side, and the people have been cursed by something evil.  How many deaths will you be responsible for this week?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and navigate a dystopic version of Tokyo at night, where danger and evil lurk around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is limited, and each night you must make tough choices about where to go and whom to care for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for limited resources wherever and however you deem necessary. Inventory space is limited, so choose wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter into the nightmarish and\u00a0byzantine senior living facilities located around the city to care for the neglected elders you are responsible for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a person's needs are not maintained, their body and soul will slowly become vulnerable to the lurking evil, leading to horrible outcomes for not only them, but also you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect omamori charms, which provide your character with powerful bonus effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself with a variety of weapons such as tasers, pepper spray, guns and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide variety of locations within this nightmarish version of Tokyo, Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for items wherever and whenever you can. You never know what you might find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the world and characters that live within it, using the immersive dialog system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/2117e3547f4bf8e11fcc095990f9b7ce.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/2117e3547f4bf8e11fcc095990f9b7ce.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/2117e3547f4bf8e11fcc095990f9b7ce.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a variety of different enemy types, ranging from mutated rats to monsters beyond our comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/7c15bd30f7fa7fa45dec5deccc966081.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/7c15bd30f7fa7fa45dec5deccc966081.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/7c15bd30f7fa7fa45dec5deccc966081.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the darkest corners of the city, creatures of nightmarish origin await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/0bc2d5ac1bd5b88870b53f3d05f68756.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/0bc2d5ac1bd5b88870b53f3d05f68756.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/0bc2d5ac1bd5b88870b53f3d05f68756.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301010?t=1759730808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/b69ae4bf6e173990a9041be607437efb1d545c6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759730808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/2cd7d53f06324f7d8afc55db809cc359bdac537b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759730808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/2cd7d53f06324f7d8afc55db809cc359bdac537b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759730808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing imagery, violence, moments of self-harm and nudity."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3966400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010