h provide your character with powerful bonus effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself with a variety of weapons such as tasers, pepper spray, guns and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide variety of locations within this nightmarish version of Tokyo, Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/3d71d2e120c3f8323802ea517889b3b0.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for items wherever and whenever you can. You never know what you might find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.poster.avif?t=1759730808\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.webm?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301010/extras/8943a4e4cd759db05c02a391ad33015c.mp4?t=1759730808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lear